  "label": "individuals identifying as non-conformists or rebels",
  "description": "The target community consists of individuals who see themselves as defying societal norms and rejecting conformity. The meme appeals to those who identify with the 'lion' persona — someone who is strong, defiant, and unwilling to accept mediocrity or comfort over personal conviction. This audience is likely to resonate with the binary worldview presented, positioning themselves as superior to the 'conformist' majority. The meme’s propaganda technique targets those seeking to assert their individuality and strength against perceived societal passivity.",
